  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop carrot and garlic.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• Drain corn kernels.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510e31b197e8b6c2f382983-db1dbff8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and corn, stirring, until softened, 5-7 minutes.\n• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot. Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Add Mexican Fiesta spice blend and garlic. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510e31b197e8b6c2f382983-ade5540d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, black beans, vegetable stock powder, the brown sugar and the hot water (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people). Stir to combine.\n• Bring to the boil then reduce heat to medium and simmer until slightly thickened, 10-15 minutes.\n• Stir in the butter. Season with salt and pepper. TIP: Butter helps balance the acidity of the tomatoes!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510e31b197e8b6c2f382983-8530bf56.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the chilli is simmering, cut mini flour tortillas (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• Place tortilla chips on a lined oven tray. Drizzle (or spray) with olive oil. Season, then arrange in a single layer.\n• When the chilli has 10 minutes remaining, bake the chips until golden, 6-8 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, spread the tortilla chips out over two oven trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510e31b197e8b6c2f382983-39b08e84.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, roughly chop coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510e31b197e8b6c2f382983-79f1e8c3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mexican bean and veggie chilli between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and coriander.\n• Top with a dollop of light sour cream. Serve with baked tortilla chips. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6510e31b197e8b6c2f382983-6f089f66.jpeg"
    }
  ]
